    <string name="info_version">v2.1 Premium (Legacy Edition)</string>
    <string name="info_desc">The ultimate tool for IR enthusiasts.\n\n• Legacy UI: Original Bruce-style horizontal carousel navigation.\n• IR Macro: Automated command sequences with custom delays and looping.\n• Customization: Personalize buttons with emojis and premium colors.\n• Smart Folders: Organize your remotes in a clean, horizontal structure.\n• USB OTG: Support for external IR adapters.\n• Bruce Web UI: Open the firmware interface in-app with automatic login.\n• Native Mirror: Real-time screen streaming and controls for Bruce devices.\n• Quick Settings: Launch macros directly from the notification shade.</string>
